ket Bikes", "segment_description": "(Studio: Bob Woodruff)  Report introduced. \n (New York: Bob Jamieson)  The pocket bike craze featured; scenes shown of mini-motorcycle enthusiasts racing on private tracks; details given about how the bikes can be modified to go faster & of various safety & accident problems.  [RIDER&nbsp- comments.]  [Connecticut state police Capt. Thomas WUENNEMANN&#134;- says the bikes are a safety hazard.]  [Rose City Cycles Dave BOSS&#134;- talks scooter sales.]  [California Highway Patrol Ron BURCH&#134;- says kids don't know the rules of the road.]", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63770.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761722, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "3rU3AlXdLt", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-07", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761715, "segment_id": "Vyrz2XZ8vy", "segment_broadcast_id": "3rU3AlXdLt", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Bob Woodruff)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63920.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761723, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "3rU3AlXdLt", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-07", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761715, "segment_id": "leDZ13JyPU", "seg